From: programista-zacny <5969291+programista-zacny@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] libprocessgroup: take the freezer controller out of the cgroup v2 list

'Revert "libprocessgroup: switch freezer to cgroup v2"' (LOS-24.0
android_system_core patch 0002) put the cgroup v1 freezer back into
"Cgroups" (mounted on /dev/freezer) and made the Frozen and Unfrozen
task profiles join /dev/freezer/frozen and /dev/freezer again. It left
the freezer in the "Controllers" list of "Cgroups2" as well.
ReadDescriptorsFromFile() reads "Cgroups" first and "Cgroups2" second
and keeps one descriptor per controller name, so the v2 entry replaces
the v1 one: the freezer is a cgroup v2 controller under /sys/fs/cgroup,
which a kernel without cgroup v2 cannot mount. As a result

- nothing mounts /dev/freezer (the init.rc lines that set up
  /dev/freezer/frozen fail silently, init does not log ENOENT),
- the JoinCgroup actions of the Frozen and Unfrozen profiles are dropped
  in every process ("A JoinCgroup action in the Frozen profile is used
  for controller freezer in the cgroup v2 hierarchy and will be
  ignored", twice per process start in the boot logs),
- the FreezerState attribute cannot be resolved ("No attribute for
  FreezerState") and system_server reports "Freezer disabled".

Remove the v2 entry. The freezer is then the v1 controller from
"Cgroups": init mounts it on /dev/freezer in SetupCgroups, the existing
init.rc lines create /dev/freezer/frozen in state FROZEN and hand its
cgroup.procs to system, and the Frozen/Unfrozen profiles move a process
into and out of that cgroup.

This alone does not turn the app freezer on. The framework also needs
BINDER_FREEZE and BINDER_GET_FROZEN_INFO in the kernel, the kernel has
to let system_server move other users' processes between freezer
cgroups and has to let frozen processes be killed (kernel patches
0014 and 0019-0021 of this project), and frameworks/base has to accept the v1
state file (patch "Freezer: support the cgroup v1 freezer").

Not built or run.

[combined set, 2026-11-06] Header only: the kernel patch numbers above
are those of the combined set (staging/backport-freezer: 0020-0025). The
diff is unchanged.
---
 libprocessgroup/profiles/cgroups.json | 7 +------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libprocessgroup/profiles/cgroups.json b/libprocessgroup/profiles/cgroups.json
index 542130e..d213663 100644
--- a/libprocessgroup/profiles/cgroups.json
+++ b/libprocessgroup/profiles/cgroups.json
@@ -49,11 +49,6 @@
     "Mode": "0775",
     "UID": "system",
     "GID": "system",
-    "Controllers": [
-      {
-        "Controller": "freezer",
-        "Path": "."
-      }
-    ]
+    "Controllers": []
   }
 }
